  "id": "L-016",
  "title": "JWT Signing Key Derived Solely from Master crypt/key — No Key Isolation",
  "description": "JWT user tokens are signed using an HMAC key derived solely from the application master crypt/key (from env.php). The key is padded with deterministic & characters to 2048 bytes. No key derivation function (KDF) is used to create a separate JWT-specific key."
}

